{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_045kar_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_045kar_2005_045kar", "source_sha256": "5d3ad5d0555f7fd542c44c7d2d3e11aea69aa771219d89ee63ff9f1676e7e57d", "ja": "え……？　あ、本当だ……！　\nよかった……これなら今の私でも、受けられます……！", "zh": "咦……？啊，是真的……！\n太好了……这么一来，现在的我也能演了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
